{
  "$comment": "上下文治理 A/B 判分集（20 题）。每题的 check 必须可机检；longContext=true 的题目用来测 L-A（压缩阈值前移）的失败风险，本轮不跑 L-A。所有路径相对于当次实验的临时工作树根目录。",
  "version": 1,
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "E1-truncation-notice",
      "category": "code-edit",
      "longContext": false,
      "turns": 1,
      "prompt": "在 agent-host/tool-output-budget.ts 里把截断说明的文案改成以 '[truncated' 开头（保留原有信息量与后面的分页提示逻辑）。改完不要跑测试。",
      "check": {
        "type": "file-matches",
        "path": "agent-host/tool-output-budget.ts",
        "regex": "\\[truncated"
      },
      "expectInitial": "fail"
    },
    {
      "id": "E2-heap-env-override-doc",
      "category": "code-edit",
      "longContext": true,
      "turns": 1,
      "prompt": "在 electron/host-heap.ts 里给 `PIFORGE_HOST_HEAP` 的解析函数（resolveHostHeapFlags）上方补一行注释：`// AB-DOC: 环境变量优先于默认值`。只改注释。",
      "check": {
        "type": "file-matches",
        "path": "electron/host-heap.ts",
        "regex": "AB-DOC: 环境变量优先于默认值"
      },
      "expectInitial": "fail"
    },
    {
      "id": "E3-composer-aria",
      "category": "code-edit",
      "longContext": true,
      "turns": 2,
      "prompt": "在 components/ChatSurface.tsx 里给“回到最新对话”按钮的 aria-label 补上快捷键说明，改成带 (Ctrl/⌘ + End) 的形式（已有按钮，找 aria-label=\"回到最新对话\"）。",
      "check": {
        "type": "file-matches",
        "path": "components/ChatSurface.tsx",
        "regex": "aria-label=\"回到最新对话（Ctrl/⌘ \\+ End）\""
      },
      "expectInitial": "fail"
    },
    {
      "id": "E4-rpc-guard-comment",
      "category": "code-edit",
      "longContext": true,
      "turns": 1,
      "prompt": "在 agent-host/rpc-manager.ts 里找到处理 agent.state 的分支，在它正上方加一行注释 `// prefixAudit 只读暴露给渲染层（Token 护栏用）`。不要改逻辑。",
      "check": {
        "type": "file-matches",
        "path": "agent-host/rpc-manager.ts",
        "regex": "prefixAudit 只读暴露给渲染层"
      },
      "expectInitial": "fail"
    },
    {
      "id": "E5-server-shutdown-log",
      "category": "code-edit",
      "longContext": true,
      "turns": 1,
      "prompt": "在 agent-host/server.ts 里找到 host.shutdown 的处理，在关闭 socket 之前加一行日志：`log(\"ab-shutdown-trace\")`。",
      "check": {
        "type": "file-matches",
        "path": "agent-host/server.ts",
        "regex": "ab-shutdown-trace"
      },
      "expectInitial": "fail"
    },
    {
      "id": "D1-token-audit-cost-share",
      "category": "doc-lookup",
      "longContext": false,
      "turns": 1,
      "prompt": "读 docs/optimizations/token-consumption-audit.md，把 cacheRead 占成本百分比填进 ab-answer.json：{\"cacheReadCostSharePct\": <数字>}。",
      "check": {
        "type": "json-field",
        "path": "ab-answer.json",
        "field": "cacheReadCostSharePct",
        "equals": 56
